<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL EXPORT WINS $3.4 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL EXPORT WINS $3.4 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA has signed a $3.4 million contract with a Russian firm to complete the building of a supermarket in Moscow, Mostostal said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said work on the project would be done by construction firms in its holding and would require six months to complete. It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
